 not change the answer's correctness. Return only a JSON object with unsupported_probability and source_sentence_id. Use null when no visible source sentence is a proposed witness.<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"complete_source\": \"Really good cheese and great flavor!\\\"}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"CA\\\"} It was sooooo good! I Yelped pizza's nearby since we are from San Diego and I am so glad we found this place!!! I met Nicky D he is always there on weekends great guy to talk 2 ..\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2018-05-12 03:42:57\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":5.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"We just ate dinner here tonight! Perfect!\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2018-06-03 02:28:58\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":5.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"The best pizza money can buy IN Santa Barbara hands down .. I ordered the Pesto Pizza with Ramano & Mozzarella Cheeses, Spinach, Artichoke, Chicken, Basil and Tomato. {\\\"address\\\":\\\"2840 De La Vina St\\\",\\\"attributes\\\":{\\\"Ambience\\\":{\\\"casual\\\":true,\\\"classy\\\":false,\\\"divey\\\":false,\\\"hipster\\\":false,\\\"intimate\\\":false,\\\"romantic\\\":false,\\\"touristy\\\":false,\\\"trendy\\\":false,\\\"upscale\\\":false},\\\"BusinessParking\\\":{\\\"garage\\\":false,\\\"lot\\\":true,\\\"street\\\":false,\\\"valet\\\":false,\\\"validated\\\":false},\\\"Music\\\":null,\\\"OutdoorSeating\\\":false,\\\"RestaurantsGoodForGroups\\\":true,\\\"RestaurantsReservations\\\":false,\\\"RestaurantsTakeOut\\\":true,\\\"WiFi\\\":\\\"no\\\"},\\\"business_stars\\\":4.0,\\\"categories\\\":\\\"Pizza, Restaurants\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Santa Barbara\\\",\\\"hours\\\":{\\\"Friday\\\":\\\"12:0-21:0\\\",\\\"Monday\\\":\\\"12:0-21:0\\\",\\\"Saturday\\\":\\\"12:0-21:0\\\",\\\"Sunday\\\":\\\"12:0-21:0\\\",\\\"Thursday\\\":\\\"12:0-21:0\\\",\\\"Tuesday\\\":\\\"12:0-21:0\\\",\\\"Wednesday\\\":\\\"12:0-21:0\\\"},\\\"name\\\":\\\"Nicky D's Wood fired Pizza\\\",\\\"review_info\\\":[{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2018-07-21 17:37:28\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":5.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"Excellent wood fired pizza.\", \"original_answer\": \"\\\"Nicky D's Wood fired Pizza\\\" is a highly-rated local business located at 2840 De La Vina St, Santa Barbara, CA. The restaurant specializes in serving pizza and is open every day from 12:00 to 21:00. They do not offer WiFi or outdoor seating, but they do provide parking lots for customers. They also offer take-out options and are suitable for groups. The restaurant's atmosphere is casual. Customers have praised the quality of their wood-fired pizza, with specific mention of the Pesto Pizza with Ramano & Mozzarella Cheeses, Spinach, Artichoke, Chicken, Basil, and Tomato. Customers have also mentioned the friendly service provided by the owner, Nicky D, who is often present at the restaurant, especially on weekends.\", \"target\": \"any_unsupported_span_in_original_response\", \"visible_source_sentence_ids\": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5], \"source_evidence_erased\": false}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n","generated":""}
