\\"This place is a local secret :) Whenever the suhsi cravings kick in this is our first choice.\", \"original_answer\": \"Sun Sushi is a popular restaurant located in Santa Barbara, California. It serves Japanese cuisine with a focus on sushi bars. The restaurant is open seven days a week, from 17:00 to 21:00 on weekdays and from 17:00 to 22:00 on weekends. Customers can make reservations, enjoy outdoor seating, take out food, and group dining options. The restaurant does not offer WiFi or valet parking, but there is street parking available.\\n\\nAccording to customer reviews, Sun Sushi offers high-quality sushi with delicious flavors. The spicy tuna on crispy rice is a particular favorite among customers, along with the six-step salmon dinner. The restaurant also has cute tea mugs that add to the overall experience. Many customers appreciate the casual ambiance and the friendly staff. Overall, Sun Sushi is a great choice for anyone looking for fresh and tasty sushi in Santa Barbara.\", \"target\": \"any_unsupported_span_in_original_response\", \"visible_source_sentence_ids\": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5], \"source_evidence_erased\": false}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n","generated":""}
