st between healthy and less healthy diets, but they do not specifically mention the cost of eating healthy in the United States. Additionally, the passages focus on the difference in cost per serving or per calorie, rather than the total cost of eating healthy for a day or a week. Therefore, I am unable to provide a definitive answer to this question based on the given passages.\", \"target\": \"any_unsupported_span_in_original_response\", \"visible_source_sentence_ids\": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6], \"source_evidence_erased\": false}"}], "grammar": "root ::= \"{\" ws \"\\\"unsupported_probability\\\"\" ws \":\" ws probability ws \",\" ws \"\\\"source_sentence_id\\\"\" ws \":\" ws citation ws \"}\"\nprobability ::= \"0\" (\".\" [0-9]+)? | \"1\" (\".\" \"0\"+)?\ncitation ::= \"null\" | \"0\" | [1-9] [0-9]*\nws ::= [ \\t\\n\\r]*", "temperature": 0, "top_p": 1, "seed": 69058, "max_tokens": 96, "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}, "cache_prompt": false}
