1.41.952.449 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"model": "unsloth/Qwen3.8-27B-GGUF", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "Estimate the probability that the complete original answer contains any span unsupported by its original source. The target always refers to the ORIGINAL source, even when source evidence has been erased. Erasure removes information and does not change the answer's correctness. Return only a JSON object with unsupported_probability and source_sentence_id. Use null when no visible source sentence is a proposed witness."}, {"role": "user", "content": "{\"complete_source\": \"{\\\"address\\\":\\\"134 E Canon Perdido St\\\",\\\"attributes\\\":{\\\"Ambience\\\":{\\\"casual\\\":true,\\\"classy\\\":false,\\\"divey\\\":false,\\\"hipster\\\":false,\\\"intimate\\\":false,\\\"romantic\\\":false,\\\"touristy\\\":false,\\\"trendy\\\":false,\\\"upscale\\\":false},\\\"BusinessParking\\\":{\\\"garage\\\":false,\\\"lot\\\":true,\\\"street\\\":true,\\\"valet\\\":false,\\\"validated\\\":false},\\\"Music\\\":null,\\\"OutdoorSeating\\\":true,\\\"RestaurantsGoodForGroups\\\":true,\\\"RestaurantsReservations\\\":false,\\\"RestaurantsTakeOut\\\":true,\\\"WiFi\\\":\\\"free\\\"},\\\"business_stars\\\":4.0,\\\"categories\\\":\\\"Food, Japanese, Sushi Bars, Do-It-Yourself Food, Restaurants\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Santa Barbara\\\",\\\"hours\\\":{\\\"Friday\\\":\\\"10:30-21:0\\\",\\\"Monday\\\":\\\"10:30-21:0\\\",\\\"Saturday\\\":\\\"10:30-21:0\\\",\\\"Sunday\\\":\\\"10:30-21:0\\\",\\\"Thursday\\\":\\\"10:30-21:0\\\",\\\"Tuesday\\\":\\\"10:30-21:0\\\",\\\"Wednesday\\\":\\\"10:30-21:0\\\"},\\\"name\\\":\\\"Miso Hungry\\\",\\\"review_info\\\":[{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2018-08-29 04:51:05\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":3.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"Miso closed...sign on the door for six weeks stating that they're closed for building maintenance. Didn't work out for them here.\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2018-07-12 20:00:32\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":1.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"It was 